            <appendix xml:id="appendix-computation" label="appendix-computation">
                <title>One More Computation</title>

                <p>An appendix holds material that would interrupt the article.  Here the second version of the Fundamental Theorem, <xref ref="corollary-FTC-derivative"/>, is applied once more, to give a numbered equation and a numbered result in an appendix.<md number="yes" xml:id="equation-appendix">\frac{d}{dx}\definiteintegral{0}{x}{e^{t}}{t}=e^x</md></p>

                <corollary xml:id="corollary-appendix">
                    <statement>
                        <p>The function <m>e^x</m> is an antiderivative of itself.</p>
                    </statement>
                </corollary>
